    "info": {
        "title": "Runware API - MiniMax H3 Max Turbo",
        "summary": "Distilled H3 Max video generation for faster iteration with native audio and first-to-last frame control",
        "description": "MiniMax H3 Max Turbo is a distilled, speed-focused variant of H3 Max designed to preserve its prompt adherence and visual character at higher throughput. It generates 5 to 15 second videos at 480p or 768p from text or an opening image, with optional end-frame guidance for controlled transitions and synchronized audio generated with the video. It is well suited to rapid creative iteration, interactive experiences, and high-volume production workflows.",
